  "schema": "clearing-cost-quantifier-final/v1",
  "scope": "Full exact existing compiler-image reflection law, fixed before emitter, not a certificate of economic success. Adds same-root projection coface preserving ledgerRoot/lawSurface/every whole write rfl and all inherited coordinates; temporalVisit canonical reconstruction internally generates full K authority certificate and certified actual submission, IsRooted with no certificate/rooted-success premise. Concrete source family jointly supplies already-audited six actual root steps, raw/native clearance, original Needs/archive/claim/history/fullcost and all seven root-position submissions Rooted. Every arbitrary RawCleared candidate has a strictly cheaper rooted complete family member in full genesis-prefix cost; no completed candidate can dominate all these fully rooted clearances. The original capital total mouth extends Institutional/Costed/Total/old quantifiers, includes every ready-cut active Binding attainer and actual epoch competitor while preserving pending tasks, exact arbitrary-delay accounting, and this source counterexample. It does not assert a universal argmin or forbid genuine production profits.",
